#: inc/Admin/Docs.php:1932
msgid "Cloudflare Turnstile (challenges.cloudflare.com), hCaptcha (js.hcaptcha.com, api.hcaptcha.com) or Google reCAPTCHA (www.google.com). The visitor’s browser loads the widget on protected forms; your server sends the answer, your secret key and the visitor’s IP address to the provider to check it. ALTCHA contacts nobody. Nothing is contacted while the provider is “None”."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Docs.php:1933
msgid "Have I Been Pwned (only with the breached-password check on)"
