#, php-format
msgid "%d user signs in with email codes, which need Authlify Pro. Pro is not active, so this user now signs in with a backup code or an emailed one-time link (the site admin is emailed each time). Activate Authlify Pro, or ask them to set up an authenticator app or a passkey."
